// Q = A while S is off, B while it's on.
name MUX 2:1
port a A in
port b B in
port s S in
port q Q out
alu U gold
chip U 0 NOT
chip U 1 AND
chip U 2 AND
chip U 3 OR
wire U in:S 0:A
wire U in:W 1:A
wire U 0:Q 1:B
wire U in:N 2:A
wire U in:S 2:B
wire U 1:Q 3:A
wire U 2:Q 3:B
wire U 3:Q out:E
layer
..b.
..-.
a-Uq
..-.
..s.
